 crashes into their lives who introduces herself as Ryou's new fiancée."},{"title":"Great explosive Debut! Love and Adoration for the Transfer Student!","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"98085","synopsis":"Ryo finds everlasting shock when Shizuka suddenly shows up in his school and advances into his 11th grade class.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80083/328062.jpg"},{"title":"Great Crash!! Dragon and Tiger of Love and Ambition","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"98086","synopsis":"Shizuka is introduced into her fiancé's workplace, the Plavi, where trouble ensues.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80083/328063.jpg"},{"title":"Decision!! Departure of Love and Blue Cloud!?","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"98087","synopsis":"Emiho confesses that she too has a planned marriage, in which Ryo debates about a person's will in such unions.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80083/328064.jpg"},{"title":"Closing in!? Hell of Steaming Love and Death.","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"98089","synopsis":"The main cast spends a day skiing on a mountain, in conjunction with Ryo and Emiho's date. When a blizzard starts getting worse, the group is forced to spend the day outliving the storm.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80083/328065.jpg"},{"title":"Impact!! At the End of Love and Sadness!","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"98088","synopsis":"Part 2 of the animated series. Ever since their parents died a few years ago, Ryo and his sister Akane have been living alone together. Despite their difficult situation, they are still living reasonably happy and normal lives. However, everything is about to be flipped upside-down due to a secret government project. Due to increasingly low birth rates in Japan, the Japanese government is testing a program in which two young people are forced to marry. Ryo wants no part of it, but he is given little choice in the matter; his new fiancée, Shizuka, comes to his home late one night with several dozen government issued bodyguards, who are there to ensure the success of the new couple. Unlike Ryo, Shizuka couldn't be more willing to go along with this new program, and eagerly goes about her wifely duties, despite his objections. With meddling friends, pushy bodyguards, and an overenthusiastic new fiancée, Ryo's life has taken a turn in a direction the young man certainly didn't expect."},{"title":"Sad Love!! Sleet of Love and Longing","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"98090","synopsis":"In practicing ignorance around Shizuka, Ryo is reproved for his action, and is given a chance to reevaluate his decision.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80083/328067.jpg"},{"title":"A Great Fever!! An \"Ah~n\" for Love and Reminisence","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"98091","synopsis":"Akane becomes ill and reflects on the life she's spent with her brother. Meanwhile Ryo goes through his school day overreacting about Akane's sickness.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80083/328068.jpg"},{"title":"Battle!! End of Love and Gun Fire!","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"98092","synopsis":"Emiho meets her betrothed for the first time. Ryo, who has already showed his dislike towards arranged marriage, decides to enlist Shizuka to help bail Emiho out.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80083/328069.jpg"},{"title":"A Great Undertaking!! The Summons of Love and Mercilessness!","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"98093","synopsis":"Shizuka's bodyguards show up one night before she has to return to her old school to take exams. They deliver a message from her father, who demands that she leaves the whole marriage behind and comes home.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80083/328070.jpg"},{"title":"Great End!? Love and Separation of Hina Dolls","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2372","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"119","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25917","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80083","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"lin